<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.cabal.joins ~ the applicant's crossing, priced and read

`lares cabal join realm=<id>` reads whether an applicant (`applicant=<nym>`, else the acting face's key there, read and never minted) crosses into the realm, writing nothing; a refusal bans nobody. `bundle=` hands a vouch bundle (a JSON file or inline), `cap=N` a per-voucher out-degree ceiling. The answer names the voucher, the capped edges and every shadow the crossing met.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ join · applicant

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`join` params=`realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef ~ read the acting face's crossing`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`applicant` params=`realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef applicant/<nym> ~ read another face's crossing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ realm · applicant · bundle · cap · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`realm` params=`takes/doc-id needs/required ~ the cabal-realm doc id, 64 hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`applicant` params=`takes/nym ~ the applicant's key; absent, the acting face's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`bundle` params=`takes/json ~ a vouch bundle, a JSON file or inline JSON`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cap` params=`takes/integer ~ the per-voucher out-degree ceiling`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the acting face, by persona index; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ read

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`read` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads the realm's boards through the store door; writes nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · cap-not-integer · bundle-unreadable · CabalJoinError · store-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.cabal.joins realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef]] ~ realm= expects a 64-hex cabal-realm doc id`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cap-not-integer` params=`cure/[[realm.cabal.joins realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef cap/3]] ~ cap= expects an integer`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`bundle-unreadable` params=`~ bundle= reads as no JSON`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`CabalJoinError` params=`~ the join read refused by name`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`store-refused` params=`~ the store door refused, or no vessel answers; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ admitted · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`admitted` params=`exit/0 fields/[[admitted voucherDid capped setAside memberSetAside frontier missing]] ~ the applicant crosses`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 fields/[[refusal capped setAside memberSetAside]] ~ the applicant stands where it stood; nothing written`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

